 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Client Onboarding Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a client onboarding questionnaire?\", \"a\": \"A client onboarding questionnaire is the set of questions a business sends a new client before work begins. It gathers the company background, goals, key contacts and anything the team needs access to. The best ones ask only what the team needs to begin.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a client onboarding questionnaire?\", \"a\": \"Write down what the work cannot start without, then describe those questions and the follow-up you want to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>. It builds the questionnaire, the reminders and the table where each client's answers live. To change a question later, ask for it in plain words.\"}, {\"q\": \"What questions should a client onboarding questionnaire include?\", \"a\": \"Start with who the main contact is and who approves work. Then ask what a good result looks like in 90 days and which accounts you will need access to. It also pays to ask what went wrong with the last provider. A bookkeeping firm adds questions on how the books are kept today.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a free client onboarding questionnaire?\", \"a\": \"Form builders and agency software companies publish free versions you can copy. Treat any client onboarding questionnaire template as a first draft. Cut each question nobody will act on in the first two weeks, then add the account access your service needs.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does a client onboarding questionnaire example look like?\", \"a\": \"A good one fits on a few phone screens. A managed IT provider's version asks how many staff and devices the client has and who holds admin rights. It ends with the last outage that cost the client a full workday. A marketing agency would swap those for brand voice and ad account access.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I use a client onboarding questionnaire template?\", \"a\": \"Treat it as a list of questions to choose from, not as the finished form. Paste the ones you keep into a prompt and mark which are required, and Emergent builds an online form that saves each answer against the client. That beats emailing a client onboarding questionnaire PDF, which comes back as an attachment someone has to retype.\"}, {\"q\": \"When should you send a new client questionnaire?\", \"a\": \"Send it as soon as the contract is signed, while the client is keen to get going. Ask for it back a few days before the kickoff call. Answers in hand before the meeting let you spend the call on decisions instead of collecting facts.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is a client onboarding form different from a questionnaire?\", \"a\": \"Mostly in depth. A client onboarding form often stops at contact and billing details, while a questionnaire covers goals, audience and the history of the account. Many teams send both as one link. Firms that screen a prospect before taking them on call that first step an intake form.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a photography client questionnaire ask?\", \"a\": \"A photography client questionnaire should ask what the photos are for and where they will run, since a website banner and a square post crop differently. Then ask for locations, who will be in frame and any must-have shots. Weddings get their own wedding photography questionnaire.\"}, {\"q\": \"What goes in a social media marketing client questionnaire?\", \"a\": \"Ask for the brand voice, the target audience, the competitor accounts the client watches and posts that worked before. Request access through each platform's business settings and never ask for a password. Agencies that also build sites follow up with a website design questionnaire.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
